I've been looking over the translated materials at lojban.org

It's quite impressive, but I was wondering if there was any early
reader books for lojban. I work at a bookstore, and as far as I can
tell, everything translated into lojban seems to be at an adult level.
We need books for people with a 3-5 year old reading level. Dick and
Jane for lack of a more culturally neutral metaphor.

Does anybody know of anything like that?

